From: SBE core-userland compatibility build
Subject: rpc-sys: use 19.07 opkg metadata and remove destructive methods

The locked rpcd commit targets apk while the factory userspace is OpenWrt
19.07/opkg. Parse the bounded opkg status fields needed by LuCI. More
importantly, do not expose upgrade_test, upgrade_start, upgrade_clean or
factory: firmware staging/writes and reset are outside this RAM-only candidate.

